# Documentation

- Update README.md when the setup, architecture, commands, environment variables, deployment process, API behavior, or user workflow changes.
- Keep the README complete but concise.
- Remove outdated README content.
- Do not add unnecessary documentation.
- Do not create extra `.md` or `.txt` files unless explicitly required.
- Avoid duplicating information across documentation files.
